        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Greater Swiss Mountain Dog, Harrier\n- Places: Swiss Alps\n- Concepts: dog breeds, hound class\n- People: Oscar the Grouch\n\nFacts:\n- The Greater Swiss Mountain Dog, also called Grosser Schweizer Sennenhund in German and Grand Bouvier Suisse in French, is a dog breed developed in the Swiss Alps.\n- The Harrier is a medium-sized dog breed in the hound class.\n- Oscar the Grouch is a top-ranked Greater Swiss Mountain Dog that was seen on the opening promo for the Dog Show on the USA Network and on Bloomberg.",
